5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I am worried about where the money actually goes. The invoices always surprise us.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We plan as if we have the staff we had five years ago. That is not true.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,The shows we are proud of on paper are not the ones people return for.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The building has limits. The floor and the diary cannot absorb everything we promise.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,We keep getting caught out at the door. I want to know where past seasons failed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, if the staff is thin, the costs will spike in unexpected places.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, exactly. I need to know who is actually standing in the room.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, the building is a constraint, but the audience is the real test.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, the audience matters, but if the structure fails, there is no show.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, I agree. The delivery is where the apologies start.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will look at the loan transport costs and the mount-making charges.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will check the conservation lab staffing and the volunteer roster composition.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will review the weekend head counts and the visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the structural survey of the suspended bay and the maintenance log.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
