35,2,1,talk,Mio,,The transport costs are huge. Nearly a third of the installation budget goes to couriers.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Victoria,,The lab is down to one person. There are two hundred pieces waiting for cleaning.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,Head counts drop in rooms with only cased objects. They climb where things move.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The suspended bay is capped at four hundred kilos. The last stonework needed shoring.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shizue,,Two openings slipped because the paperwork arrived after the shipping cut-off.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, if the bay is capped, we cannot hang heavy things there.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shion, yes. And the volunteers are mostly the town history circle. They are busy.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, if the lab is backed up, any new finds will sit in a box.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, correct. And the maintenance log shows seventeen call-outs for powered displays.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Mio, the transport costs are a silent killer. We need to avoid heavy loans.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,The joiner's rate has risen by half. Bespoke mounts are expensive.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Victoria,,We cannot rely on the volunteers for daily coverage. They have their own walks.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"The comment slips say people come back because someone was present, working or talking.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,The evening hires damage open arrangements. We need things that can be shut up.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shizue,,The shipping delays are a real risk. We need local or already-held items.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
