60,3,1,talk,Mio,,Candidate A is local. No transport costs. But it needs demonstration sessions.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,Candidate A needs craftspeople. We have no staff for that. The volunteers are busy.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shion,,Candidate A has people present. That matches the comment slips.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Candidate A is light. No heavy rigging. It fits the structural limits.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Shizue,,Candidate A is local. No shipping cut-offs. It is safe from delays.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,Candidate B is kinetic. That means maintenance call-outs. I saw the log.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,Candidate B needs darkened zones. The evening hires will damage the open works.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shion,,Candidate B has motion. Head counts climb there. But is it sustainable?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,Candidate B needs overhead rigging. The bay is capped. It is a structural risk.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Shizue,,Candidate B is from artist studios. Shipping delays are likely.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,Candidate C is maritime. Heavy loans. The transport costs will be high.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,Candidate C needs conservation. The lab is backed up. It will sit in a box.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shion,,Candidate C is cased objects. Head counts drop there. It is boring.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Asuka,,Candidate C has ship models. They are heavy. The bay might not hold them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Shizue,,Candidate C is from partner collections. Paperwork delays are a real risk.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,Candidate D is excavation finds. They need conservation. The lab is full.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Victoria,,Candidate D has a working bench. That needs staff. We have one person.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shion,,Candidate D has a working bench. People are present. It matches the slips.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Asuka,,Candidate D is reconstructions. They are heavy. The bay is capped.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Shizue,,Candidate D is local finds. No shipping. But the conservation backlog is a problem.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
